&lt;p&gt;    Currently, you have to edit some code in order to bypass the test launched by grunt, and it doesn&apos;t seem right for `-DskipTests` to no skip the WebApp tests.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    In order to apply that rule, we need to bump the version of `frontend-maven-plugin` to 0.0.25. Sadly they do not have a changelog, so we need to make sure everything is alright.&lt;/p&gt;

